  "name": {
   "zh": "面部动作 · Pixel3DMM",
   "en": "Face Motion · Pixel3DMM"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Pixel3DMM 是一组高度泛化的视觉 transformer：逐像素预测几何线索（法线和规范面部 UV），用来约束三维形变人脸模型（3DMM）的优化。这张卡把 FLAME 头部网格拟合到整段脸部特写，交付带表情形变的头（网格、102 个融合变形 与逐帧权重、下巴 / 脖子 / 眼球关节动画）和它解出的摄影机。",
   "en": "Pixel3DMM is a set of highly generalizable vision transformers that predict per-pixel geometric cues (normals and canonical face UVs) to constrain the optimization of a 3D morphable face model (3DMM). This card fits the FLAME head to a whole face close-up and delivers a head with expression deformation (mesh, 102 blend shapes with per-frame weights, jaw / neck / eye joint animation) and the camera it solves."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-19T22:00:00",
  "deliverable": "face_anim",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
